    "The Birmingham files numbered 1-3 are contiguous angular ranges, not repeat scans.",
    "Poisson uncertainties are inferred as sqrt(max(counts, 1)); none are deposited.",
    "The 1.6% K-alpha2 component is documented but the current Le Bail profile estimator uses the dominant K-alpha1 wavelength, so this is an empirical baseline gate rather than a fixed-spectrum fundamental-parameters calibration.",
